.DS_Store
/reference
/target
# Scratch space for release notes, one-off repro binaries, captured payloads:
# in-repo so that work stays next to the code it is about, untracked so none of
# it reaches the `.crate` or a commit.
/tmp

# The fuzzer's scratch space: `corpus/` is the coverage-guided working set it
# rewrites on every run, `artifacts/` is where a crash lands. The curated inputs
# are `fuzz/seeds/`, which is committed and replayed by `tests/fuzz_seeds.rs`.
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
